  "content": "<span>Economic Impact</span> <span><span>mccorkleml@ornl.gov</span></span> <span><time datetime=\"2026-08-18T11:58:46-04:00\" title=\"Tuesday, August 18, 2026 - 11:58\">Tue, 08/18/2026 - 11:58</time> </span> <div class=\"field-wrapper\"> <div class=\"field-container\"> <div class=\"field-element\"> <div data-component-id=\"ornl:button\" class=\"paragraph paragraph--type--lp-featured-blurb paragraph--view-mode--default lp-featured-blurb-hale-navy-bkg\"> <div class=\"container-featured-blurb\"> <div class=\"featured__object\"> <div class=\"featured__img-animation-wrap\"> <div class=\"featured__hover-wrapper\"> <div> <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.ornl.gov/sites/default/files/styles/featured_blurb_image/public/2026-08/OPAL%20co-sceitntist.png?h=2e98daf6&amp;itok=9jftpG8U\" width=\"680\" height=\"460\" alt=\"A scientist wearing safety glasses and blue gloves uses a pipette to work with samples arranged in trays on a laboratory bench.\"> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"featured__object--desc\"> <h3> <div class=\"field-wrapper\"> <div class=\"field-container\"> <div class=\"field-element\">Economic Impact Report </div> </div> </div> </h3> <p></p> <p> </p><div class=\"field-wrapper\"> <div class=\"field-container\"> <div class=\"field-element\"><p>In fiscal year 2025, ORNL created an economic output of $6.6 billion across the United States.&nbsp;</p></div> </div> </div> <a class=\"button button--primary-dark\" href=\"https://www.ornl.gov/file/fy25-economic-impact-report/display\">Read the full report </a> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"field-element\"> <div class=\"paragraph paragraph--type--lp-justified-text paragraph--view-mode--default\"> <div class=\"field-wrapper\"> <div class=\"field-container\"> <div class=\"field-element\"><h2>How ORNL Creates Economic Impact</h2><p>Decades of economic research and federal statistical analysis demonstrate that innovation is the primary driver of long-term economic growth in the United States. As a core component of total factor productivity, federal R&amp;D investment is a key driver for the economic strength of the nation. Federal basic research funds science that the private sector can build upon, while generating spillovers through patents, STEM talent, and breakthrough technologies.</p><p>As one of the nation’s premier federally funded research laboratories, ORNL operates at the center of the innovation ecosystem by translating that federal research investment into scientific breakthroughs, technology commercialization, workforce development, and industry partnerships that strengthen productivity and contribute directly to long-term US economic growth.</p></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"field-element\"> <div class=\"paragraph paragraph--type--lp-icon-list paragraph--view-mode--default lp-icon-dark-green-bkg lp-icon-dark-green-text\"> <a name=\"86968\"></a> <div class=\"icon-list-wrapper\"> <div class=\"icon-list-hdr-wrapper\"> <h2>ORNL's Impact by the Numbers </h2> </div> <div class=\"lp-icon-list-panels\"> <div class=\"lp-icon-list-panel-link\"> <div class=\"lp-icon-list-panel-wrapper\"> <div class=\"lp-icon-list-caption-icon\"> <div class=\"field-wrapper\"> <div class=\"field-container\"> <div class=\"field-element\"> <article aria-label=\"Budget_Icon.svg\"> <div> <img alt width=\"100\" height=\"100\" aria-label src=\"https://www.ornl.gov/sites/default/files/2025-05/Budget_Icon.svg\"> </div> </article> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"lp-icon-list-caption\"> <span class=\"lp-icon-list-cap-hdr\">$6.6B</span> <br> <span class=\"lp-icon-list-cap-txt\">Total US economic impact</span> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"lp-icon-list-panel-link\"> <div class=\"lp-icon-list-panel-wrapper\"> <div class=\"lp-icon-list-caption-icon\"> <div class=\"field-wrapper\"> <div class=\"field-container\"> <div class=\"field-element\"> <article aria-label=\"Staff_Icon.svg\"> <div> <img alt width=\"100\" height=\"100\" aria-label src=\"https://www.ornl.gov/sites/default/files/2025-05/Staff_Icon.svg\"> </div> </article> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"lp-icon-list-caption\"> <span class=\"lp-icon-list-cap-hdr\">25,819 </span> <br> <span class=\"lp-icon-list-cap-txt\">Total US jobs supported</span> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"lp-icon-list-panel-link\"> <div class=\"lp-icon-list-panel-wrapper\"> <div class=\"lp-icon-list-caption-icon\"> <div class=\"field-wrapper\"> <div class=\"field-container\"> <div class=\"field-element\"> <article aria-label=\"WorkforceLeader.svg\"> <div> <img alt width=\"100\" height=\"100\" aria-label src=\"https://www.ornl.gov/sites/default/files/2025-11/WorkforceLeader.svg\"> </div> </article> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"lp-icon-list-caption\"> <span class=\"lp-icon-list-cap-hdr\">$3.6B</span> <br> <span class=\"lp-icon-list-cap-txt\">Total Tennessee economic impact</span> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"lp-icon-list-panel-link\"> <div class=\"lp-icon-list-panel-wrapper\"> <div class=\"lp-icon-list-caption-icon\"> <div class=\"field-wrapper\"> <div class=\"field-container\"> <div class=\"field-element\"> <article aria-label=\"ManagementContract_Ic",
